{"parentUuid":"3bc83c10-9c00-4238-bf85-95a19287899b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwZrwBUgXm5594ctQWey","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I pushed the PLAN.md and tray commits, then cleaned up the repository and pushed that too (`e5c68d0`). fmt, the seam check, clippy, the tests and the safeguard all passed before the push, and the working tree is clean.\n\nWhat I cleaned up:\n- **Phase tags:** 68 code comments cited phases of the deleted plan, such as `(F11)` or `(R4)`. I removed the tags and kept the comments.\n- **README:** it had no install section, so I added one: `install.sh`, Homebrew, `bastion update` and `--service`. The parts table now lists `bastion-client` and the `bastion` CLI, and the opening names both clients. Voice-check found nothing new; it still notes the README has no first person, as it did before.\n- **Leftover files:** I deleted `dist/`, which held packages from a local test build (version `0.0.0-test`), and the empty `agents/` folder.\n\nWhat I checked and left alone:\n- **`data/`** (886 MB): this is the live dev stack's state, and `data/observability` is 836 MB of it. It is gitignored, as are `config/`, `skills/` and `.iii/`. The engine is using them.\n- **`docs/engine-findings.md`:** it describes itself as a dated record of the spikes, and it already says Tauri, Leptos and Trunk have left Bastion.\n- **The two unused workers** (`opengantry`, `approval-gate`) in `worker-compose.yaml`: they are one of the open questions in DECISIONS.md.\n\nI'm ready for the first page."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":305,"cache_read_input_tokens":260461,"output_tokens":515,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":305,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":515,"cache_read_input_tokens":260461,"cache_creation_input_tokens":305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":305},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c967dd88-0c8a-4a94-9186-cc4a05c65067","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwZrveVHYVTnK8xA56vi","type":"assistant","uuid":"1ff234ff-8e43-4025-8f67-a1de2bd019f9","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:52:58.924Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
