{"parentUuid":"9f59840b-55db-4b02-9051-391755ebce80","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01WxzQ7uUa8GjGWg7nDMhmHg","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a4e16e82-83c5-41f2-8ae8-9361eb12c5d4","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:01:47.660Z","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"a4e16e82-83c5-41f2-8ae8-9361eb12c5d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwaXoi6dUgkgpV56HyG8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the jobs list and the artifact text, and added range comments. All CI steps and the safeguard pass, and the work is committed as `45e57ac` (not pushed).\n\n**Jobs list**\n- **Edge and hover:** rows sit 6 px inside the card and have rounded corners. A hovered row no longer paints over the card's yellow edge.\n- **Hover color:** it is now a color of its own (`RAISED`) instead of the line color. That color was why the stage chip (\"build\", \"land\") vanished on a hovered row.\n- **Titles:** a title is the first line of the request, in medium weight at 15 px, cut at a word with \"…\" after about 120 characters. The job page still shows the whole request.\n\n**Artifact text**\n- The markdown used iced's default system font, not the app's font, which is why it looked squeezed. It now uses the app's font.\n- Inline code had a near-black highlight that vanished on the dark block. It now has a visible highlight with 3 px of padding.\n\n**Range comments:** click a diff line, and the note gets `calc.py:12: ` as before. Then shift-click another line in the same file, and that reference widens to `calc.py:12-15: `. The chosen lines stay tinted purple. A click without shift, or a click in another file, starts a new reference. If you have edited the reference out of the note, a shift-click adds a new one instead. The heading above the diff says how.\n\nI saw the new titles and chips in my dev build: one line each, with every chip and the yellow edge in view. I could not check the hover state, the markdown blocks, or shift-click myself: the cursor tool can't hover, and my clicks stopped reaching the window. Please try them in the dev build I left running, PID 18422 (`target/debug/bastion-desktop`). Your installed app, PID 15714, still runs v0.1.1 without these changes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":310,"cache_read_input_tokens":310968,"output_tokens":603,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":310,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":603,"cache_read_input_tokens":310968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":310,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":310},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6a2ce3bd-c213-4a17-87c8-31e5588e6ac5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwaXoJJi6Q26u35dYr7n","type":"assistant","uuid":"796bb965-1239-4a32-9811-d85458753554","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:01:47.658Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
