{"parentUuid":"4ebb18c9-b61d-4caa-af84-7d2f966c03d7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwcmgdb378eD1319xmLx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Built-in agent stages draw their instructions from brief.rs and the step note only adds to them, while skill steps run SKILL.md and command steps run a shell line in the VM. I'm putting three design choices to you next.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2372,"cache_read_input_tokens":446612,"output_tokens":1547,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":757},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2372,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1547,"cache_read_input_tokens":446612,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2372,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2372},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ceb0d6e8-cb8e-4761-b586-253f04ea63be","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgwcmg2rrMyFRekgLmVEK","type":"assistant","uuid":"cc9f070e-f266-44a8-8f37-5d6b67d71759","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:31:12.262Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"cc9f070e-f266-44a8-8f37-5d6b67d71759","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwcmgdb378eD1319xmLx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0188aQfgCLk6TbDiLpavPkGr","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"For Bastion's agent stages (plan, build, code review, and the rest), what should a step's editable text be?","header":"Stage text","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Full instructions (Recommended)","description":"The step shows the stage's built-in instructions, filled in. An edit replaces them for this workflow, and clearing the text puts the built-in instructions back. Risk: stages whose reply Bastion parses (specify, discover, scope, learn) break if an edit changes the reply format they ask for."},{"label":"Extra notes only","description":"The built-in instructions stay fixed and hidden. The text adds to them, as the note does today."},{"label":"Instructions, shape locked","description":"Show and edit the instructions. Bastion keeps the reply-format part fixed and appends it, so an edit cannot break the parsing."}]},{"question":"Which ways to run should a step offer? Each one has one text box.","header":"Run kinds","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"5 kinds (Recommended)","description":"Prompt (an agent turn with your text), Agent (.claude/agents/<name>), Skill (.claude/skills/<name>), Command (.claude/commands/<name>), and Shell (a script or a one-line CLI command, run in the VM). Shell script and CLI command are one kind, because both run through sh."},{"label":"6 kinds","description":"The same, but Shell script (several lines) and CLI command (one line) are separate kinds."},{"label":"Prompt and Shell only","description":"Prompt and Shell. A skill, agent or command is a prompt that names it, such as \"Follow .claude/skills/x\"."}]},{"question":"Some Bastion stages run no agent: land, merge, CI, deploy, ship. What should their text box hold?","