{"parentUuid":"9d89f8fa-3102-4ade-81e6-8cd742dada30","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6cdd044d-0af5-4607-b3c2-163d5cb0b235","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C7LwN1LugqbWAxHgvtAwz6","type":"tool_result","content":"40:pub enum Stage {\n41-    /// An agent reads the code and writes a plan.\n42-    Plan,\n43-    /// The owner approves the plan, or comments on it.\n44-    Approve,\n45-    /// An agent carries the plan out.\n46-    Build,\n47-    /// The owner approves the change, or comments on it.\n48-    Review,\n49-    /// The change lands on the workspace's branch.\n50-    Land,\n51-    // The full pipeline's own stages, after wipp's.\n52-    /// The workspace's setup steps run in the VM.\n53-    Prepare,\n54-    /// An agent judges whether the request is one change or several.\n55-    Scope,\n56-    /// An agent reads the code and lists the tasks, and the questions it has.\n57-    Discover,\n58-    /// The owner answers discovery's questions.\n59-    Clarify,\n60-    /// An agent writes the acceptance criteria as scenarios.\n61-    Define,\n62-    /// The owner approves the criteria, or comments on them.\n63-    YourChecks,\n64-    /// An agent writes the acceptance tests and the commands that run them.\n65-    Specify,\n66-    /// The acceptance tests run before the build, and must fail.\n67-    Baseline,\n68-    /// An agent carries out one task, tests first.\n69-    Implement,\n70-    /// The workspace's test suites run.\n71-    Checks,\n72-    /// The approved acceptance tests run, and must pass.\n73-    Verify,\n74-    /// An agent proposes refactorings.\n75-    Refactor,\n76-    /// The owner picks the refactorings to make, or none.\n77-    PickRefactors,\n78-    /// The acceptance tests run again, after the refactoring.\n79-    Acceptance,\n80-    /// An agent reviews the change.\n81-    CodeReview,\n82-    /// The owner picks the review findings to fix, or none.\n83-    PickFindings,\n84-    /// The factory commits, pushes and opens the pull request.\n85-    Ship,\n86-    /// CI runs on the pull request.\n87-    Ci,\n88-    /// An agent fixes what CI found.\n89-    CiFix,\n90-    /// An agent proves the change meets its criteria, with evidence.\n156:    pub fn kind(self) -> Kind {\n157-        use Stage::*;\n158-        match self {\n159-            Approve | Review | Clarify | YourChecks | PickRefactors | PickFindings => {\n--\n180:    pub fn dialed(self) -> bool {\n181-        self.kind() != Kind::Checkpoint && !matches!(self, Stage::CiFix | Stage::Falsify)\n182-    }\n183-","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"cb21588b-7cfd-438d-b5f5-b64ec0143a0c","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:32:51.792Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"40:pub enum Stage {\n41-    /// An agent reads the code and writes a plan.\n42-    Plan,\n43-    /// The owner approves the plan, or comments on it.\n44-    Approve,\n45-    /// An agent carries the plan out.\n46-    Build,\n47-    /// The owner approves the change, or comments on it.\n48-    Review,\n49-    /// The change lands on the workspace's branch.\n50-    Land,\n51-    // The full pipeline's own stages, after wipp's.\n52-    /// The workspace's setup steps run in the VM.\n53-    Prepare,\n54-    /// An agent judges whether the request is one change or several.\n55-    Scope,\n56-    /// An agent reads the code and lists the tasks, and the questions it has.\n57-    Discover,\n58-    /// The owner answers discovery's questions.\n59-    Clarify,\n60-    /// An agent writes the acceptance criteria as scenarios.\n61-    Define,\n62-    /// The owner approves the criteria, or comments on them.\n63-    YourChecks,\n64-    /// An agent writes the acceptance tests and the commands that run them.\n65-    Specify,\n66-    /// The acceptance tests run before the build, and must fail.\n67-    Baseline,\n68-    /// An agent carries out one task, tests first.\n69-    Implement,\n70-    /// The workspace's test suites run.\n71-    Checks,\n72-    /// The approved acceptance tests run, 