{"parentUuid":"f52fb6bf-a776-4961-a4f6-da93683d15da","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwddC8iXYpDniqTReppY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":889,"cache_read_input_tokens":532874,"output_tokens":1351,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":56},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":889,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1351,"cache_read_input_tokens":532874,"cache_creation_input_tokens":889,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":889},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e668d70c-aa72-425b-8141-68f557fcb3d0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwddBivQB4YYsWsirpGS","type":"assistant","uuid":"54133e4f-f85e-4ca6-8e1b-a9f9d92e037b","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:42:21.946Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"54133e4f-f85e-4ca6-8e1b-a9f9d92e037b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwddC8iXYpDniqTReppY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The work is committed as `3ca0047`, not pushed. All CI steps and the safeguard pass.\n\n**What changed**\n- **One way to add a step:** \"Add a step\" adds a prompt. The step's \"Runs as\" picker sets its kind: Prompt, Agent (`.claude/agents`), Skill, Command (`.claude/commands`), Shell script, or a built-in stage.\n- **Every step has one large text box:**\n  - A prompt's instructions.\n  - What to add to an agent, skill or command.\n  - A shell step's script.\n  - A stage's own instructions, shown in full and ready to edit. Clearing the box puts the built-in back.\n- **Dials on the canvas:** each step shows a sun (lights-on) or a moon (dark) instead of the word. I saw both live.\n- **Stored workflows:** the old shell step is renamed from `command` to `shell` in every saved workflow and job.\n\n**I lost data on your dev database, and I need to tell you.** My first version of migration 4 rebuilt the `jobs` table without the columns added by later ALTERs. On your dev database (`data/bastion.db`), all 59 jobs lost these fields: requester, pipeline, workflow, workflow version, node, parent, after_job, part, approved, model, criteria, back_to, last_refusal, done_tasks and falsify_tried. The other fields, including the PR, are kept. There is no backup, because Time Machine's disk is not mounted.\n\nI fixed the migration before the commit, and a test now checks that it keeps every column. Your installed app's data was never touched, because v0.1.1 has no migration 4. The dev jobs still list, but the two waiting test jobs may not run correctly, because they lost their workflow. If you want, I can clear the dev data and start fresh.\n\n**Not built yet:** the shell override for land, merge, CI, deploy and ship. Those steps now say \"Bastion does this step itself\". Your next question affects that override, so I'm leaving it for now.\n\n**What a Bastion stage is:** it is a built-in step that the factory's state machine knows by name. Two kinds exist:\n- **Agent stages:** plan, build, scope, specify, code review, prove, learn and the rest. Each is an agent turn with built-in instructions. Some carry built-in behavior: plan's output becomes the plan that build follows, scope splits a job into parts, and specify's JSON drives the acceptance tests.\n- **Factory actions:** land, ship, merge, deploy, CI, verify. These are not prompts. They are Bastion's own git, PR and merge work, with the gates and the audit around it.\n\nSo most stages could become plain steps. The landing and merging steps cannot be just text."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":889,"cache_read_input_tokens":532874,"output_tokens":1351,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":56},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":889,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1351,"cache_read_input_tokens":532874,"cache_creation_input_tokens":889,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":889},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e668d70c-aa72-425b-8141-68f557fcb3d0","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgwddBivQB4YYsWsirpGS","type":"assistant","uuid":"ef07cc9c-df04-422d-8e39-32da54672deb","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:42:24.103Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"ef07cc9c-df04-422d-8e39-32da54672deb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwddC8iXYpDniqTReppY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015MueXSBcsp92VWtmXKWE52","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"How far should the \"Bastion stage\" concept go away?","header":"Stages","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Hide it in the UI (Recommended)","description":"Everything reads as a series of steps. \"Runs as\" lists Prompt, Agent, Skill, Command, Shell, then named steps such as Plan, Build, Land or Merge, with no \"Bastion stage\" label. The engine keeps them, so land and merge stay safe. Small change."},{"label":"Agent stages become prompts","description":"Plan, build, review and the rest become plain prompt steps that start with the built-in text. Only actions such as Land, Ship, Merge, CI and Deploy stay special. Plan-to-build handoff, scope splits and specify's tests need rework. Large change."},{"label":"Remove it fully","description":"Every step is a prompt, agent, skill, command or shell script, and landing is a shell script you write. The PR, merge and gate safety Bastion gives today goes away. Very large change."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":889,"cache_read_input_tokens":532874,"output_tokens":1351,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":56},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":889,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1351,"cache_read_input_tokens":532874,"cache_creation_input_tokens":889,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":889},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_015MueXSBcsp92VWtmXKWE52":{"questions":[{"question":"How far should the \"Bastion stage\" concept go away?","header":"Stages","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Hide it in the UI (Recommended)","description":"Everything reads as a series of steps. \"Runs as\" lists Prompt, Agent, Skill, Command, Shell, then named steps such as Plan, Build, Land or Merge, with no \"Bastion stage\" label. The engine keeps them, so land and merge stay safe. Small change."},{"label":"Agent stages become prompts","description":"Plan, build, review and the rest become plain prompt steps that start with the built-in text. Only actions such as Land, Ship, Merge, CI and Deploy stay special. Plan-to-build handoff, scope splits and specify's tests need rework. Large change."},{"label":"Remove it fully","description":"Every step is a prompt, agent, skill, command or shell script, and landing is a shell script you write. The PR, merge and gate safety Bastion gives today goes away. Very large change."}]}]}},"serverClassifierRequest":"e668d70c-aa72-425b-8141-68f557fcb3d0","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgwddBivQB4YYsWsirpGS","type":"assistant","uuid":"9f619d36-fa08-414c-a72c-f3115bb35b76","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:42:27.686Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
