{"parentUuid":"e3b44f1b-736f-4488-b541-ad2360dd3ef7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwewU3ohsYQEUY6QTDje","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The workflow is saved (`w9484e9a5`), and the server accepted it with no land step. The last thing the test needs is the GitHub token in the vault. Please store it yourself:\n\n```\n! iii trigger --engine ws://127.0.0.1:49160 -n bastion secrets::set --json \"{\\\"name\\\":\\\"GH_TOKEN\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"$(gh auth token)\\\",\\\"store\\\":\\\"vault\\\"}\"\n```\n\n- **What it stores:** your `gh` login's token, under the name `GH_TOKEN`. The output shows only a masked hint, never the value.\n- **What the account needs:** push access to `ianparo/bastion-demo`.\n- **Who can read it:** the vault lists no consumers, so nothing else can read it. Bastion names itself a consumer only while it reads the value for a step, then puts the list back.\n\nThen I'll submit a test request on `demo-gh` with the \"Steps to a PR\" workflow, and watch it plan, build, test, and open the PR."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2146,"cache_read_input_tokens":634362,"output_tokens":492,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":160},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2146,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":492,"cache_read_input_tokens":634362,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2146,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2146},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"34061194-e279-4d2a-a3da-274c80e3de5b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgwewTRc1piDo3U