e, v))))\n        .style(theme::field);\n    let head = labeled(\"Name\", name);'''),\n])\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace('''    #[test]\n    fn a_step_shows_its_text''','''    #[test]\n    fn a_step_is_renamed_with_its_links_once_the_name_is_free() {\n        let mut w = workflow(\"mine\", 1, false);\n        edit::add_step(&mut w, \"prompt\");\n        edit::add_step(&mut w, \"shell\");\n        assert_eq!((w.nodes[0].id.as_str(), w.nodes[1].id.as_str()), (\"step\", \"step2\"));\n        edit::add_link(&mut w, \"step\", \"step2\");\n        let mut state = State {\n            draft: Some(w),\n            admin: true,\n            ..State::default()\n        };\n        state.pick(Pick::Step(\"step\".into()));\n        on_field(&mut state, StepField::Name, \"step2\".into());\n        assert_eq!(state.picked, Pick::Step(\"step\".into()), \"a taken name waits\");\n        on_field(&mut state, StepField::Name, \"plan\".into());\n        let w = state.draft.as_ref().unwrap();\n        assert_eq!((w.nodes[0].id.as_str(), w.links[0].from.as_str()), (\"plan\", \"plan\"));\n        assert_eq!(state.picked, Pick::Step(\"plan\".into()));\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn a_step_shows_its_text''',1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncargo fmt --all && CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 cargo test -q -p bastion-desktop 2>&1 | grep -E \"^(error|warning)|test result|FAILED|panicked\" -A8 | head -30","description":"Add step name field and rename test","timeout":600000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01HZNExrtheJDqQ3WwZx9x7s":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"5a7920a1-c5bb-45e8-a4a3-869fcf08c80f","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgwf9EcWBK79GpHMpDqHW","type":"assistant","uuid":"48290dcc-6128-4f5e-a83a-02626e0b6cf1","timestamp":"2026-11-11T19:02:21.290Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4