{"parentUuid":"18643a40-aeb7-42fb-b5dd-6cb62bd114f6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01DrrSe1HGrA8bgirpVrcvh1","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"22aca98a-8bfe-4b25-97ad-d33a7385e6ec","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:05:48.386Z","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"22aca98a-8bfe-4b25-97ad-d33a7385e6ec","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwpZoNhVMFMAtK8wDj6d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"S3 is committed (`722cd0e`), and so is the vision update (`875a965`). Every CI step and the safeguard pass. Nothing is pushed.\n\n**S3 checked live:**\n- **What I ran:** a one-step workflow with a read-only prompt, told to write `NOTES.md` on `demo-local`.\n- **What happened:** the gate refused the write, and no file was written. The audit log reads `deny (This step only reads: it may not write a file.) sandbox::fs::write /work/repo/NOTES.md`.\n- **Behind it:** an agent's step can be marked \"only reads\", and the editor has a checkbox for it. The seeded planning and criteria steps read only, and so does a converted plan step.\n- **Notices:** they name the step, such as \"waits for you at plan\", not \"at prompt\".\n- **Moved to S4:** the per-stage dials in Settings and the per-stage evals reach only the stage code S4 deletes, so they go with it.\n\n**The vision now says:** a server's settings are live controls, not a config file. Each value you change in the app changes how that server's iii engine behaves on the next call or job: the model a turn runs on, the calls an agent may make, the image a VM boots, what a step does. Bastion's job is to turn your values into iii's behavior.\n\n**One detail I saw:** the audit's decision entry still names the kind (\"prompt: approved by its dark dial\"), not the step name. It's small, and I'll fix it in S4.\n\nNext is S4: delete the stage code, migrate stored jobs and workflows to steps, and update DECISIONS and the README."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":673,"cache_read_input_tokens":756545,"output_tokens":523,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":673,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":523,"cache_read_input_tokens":756545,"cache_creation_input_tokens":673,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":673},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5494c56d-93be-416d-a368-e1152c235bdc","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwpZnrwjoNuoPDeBK7cv","type":"assistant","uuid":"29f97c96-114b-4c14-a70e-0dac6abc7dfa","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:05:48.382Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
