{"parentUuid":"0d843cb2-863e-4058-9a43-c0c625eb4ea8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01RELLYCi2nDhsY4LUVkT5gp","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"331de233-2acb-4539-8cc6-6c0a84b11e94","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:53:41.983Z","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"331de233-2acb-4539-8cc6-6c0a84b11e94","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwtDhRgT5XSvgHjSQxFk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"S4 and both hosting plans are pushed, and CI passed on ubuntu-24.04 and macos-latest.\n\n- **Hosting plans:** before I committed `docs/hosting/digitalocean.md`, I cut it under the 4,500-word cap. Its flow still scores 21%, against a 45% target. Most of the page is numbered steps, where short sentences are normal, so I left it.\n- **Jobs and the other record pages:** I agree, jobs already work this way. I rewrote the two-levels section of VISION.md (commit `5df1c16`, pushed):\n  - **Records:** Jobs, Audit Log and Costs show one server, or all of them. \"All servers\" is one more choice in the server picker.\n  - **Rules:** Workflows, Constraints, Capabilities, Evals, Verification, Engine and Settings show one server at a time, because one server's rules don't apply to another server's jobs.\n- **Voice check on VISION.md:** it still reports that the page has no first person. That was true before my edit. It needs an aside in your own words, so I didn't write one.\n\nNext I'll replace the sidebar with a top bar, with the castle image and the server picker in it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":220,"cache_read_input_tokens":318037,"output_tokens":388,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":220,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":388,"cache_read_input_tokens":318037,"cache_creation_input_tokens":220,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":220},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"i