ED),\n    }\n}\n\n/// A state's mark as a widget, `size` across: a turning dashed circle while\n/// in progress.\npub fn mark_view<'a, M: 'a>(state: &str, size: f32) -> Element<'a, M> {\n    let (symbol, color) = mark(state);\n    match IN_PROGRESS.contains(&state) {\n        true => spinner::spinner(size * 0.8, color),\n        false => text(symbol).size(size).color(color).into(),\n    }\n}\n\n/// \"3 min ago\", from seconds since the epoch.\npub fn ago(at: u64) -> String {\n    let now = SystemTime::now()\n        .duration_since(UNIX_EPOCH)\n        .map_or(0, |d| d.as_secs());\n121:pub fn section<'a, M: 'a>(title: String, body: Element<'a, M>, accent: bool) -> Element<'a, M> {\n122-    let head =\n123-        container(text(title).size(13).color(theme::MUTED).font(theme::BOLD)).padding([8, 12]);\n124-    let style = if accent {\n--\n161:pub fn scrolled<'a, M: 'a>(body: impl Into<Element<'a, M>>) -> Element<'a, M> {\n162-    let body = container(body).padding(iced::Padding::ZERO.right(16));\n163-    iced::widget::scrollable(body)\n164-        .id(SCROLL)\n--\n170:pub fn labeled<'a, M: 'a>(label: &'a str, field: impl Into<Element<'a, M>>) -> Element<'a, M> {\n171-    column![text(label).size(13).color(theme::MUTED), field.into()]\n172-        .spacing(4)\n173-        .into()","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c9bbfad4-cb13-4f62-942e-e9a63515dd39","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:59:21.532Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"13:pub trait Request: Serialize {\n14-    const METHOD: &'static str;\n15-    /// The route as the server's router names it, `{name}` for a part of\n16-    /// the path.\n17-    const ROUTE: &'static str;\n18-    const BODY: bool = false;\n19-    /// How long the answer may take, in seconds, when longer than a call's\n20-    /// usual limit.\n21-    const WAIT_SECS: Option<u64> = None;\n22-    type Answer: DeserializeOwned;\n23-\n24-    /// The path this request goes to.\n25-    fn path(&self) -> String {\n\n    /// A task that sends `request` to `on` and hands i